    "A few quiet reminders, only in working hours and never during Focus. You choose which." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pár tichých pripomienok, len v pracovnom čase a nikdy počas Sústredenia. Ty vyberáš ktoré."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A log without descriptions or tokens, to attach to a bug report" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Záznam bez popisov a tokenov, na priloženie k hláseniu chyby"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A personal access token (PAT) is a password just for apps. tikjot uses it to read your tasks and write your worklogs as you. You can revoke it any time without changing your Jira password." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Osobný prístupový token (PAT) je heslo len pre aplikácie. tikjot ním číta tvoje úlohy a zapisuje worklogy v tvojom mene. Kedykoľvek ho môžeš zrušiť bez zmeny hesla do Jiry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A project groups tasks by their Jira key, sets the colour and whether the time is billable." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Projekt združuje úlohy podľa kľúča v Jire, určuje farbu a či je čas fakturovateľný."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A project with entries can't be deleted — merge it into another." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Projekt so záznamami sa nedá zmazať — zlúč ho do iného."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet reminder when nothing's ticking during work, when a timer runs long, and when days aren't in Jira yet. Silent in Focus." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tiché pripomenutie, keď počas práce nič netiká, keď časovač beží pridlho a keď dni ešte nie sú v Jire. V režime Sústredenie mlčí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a quiet row that doesn't count" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "tichý riadok, ktorý sa nepočíta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A running timer can't be merged — stop it first" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bežiaci časovač sa nedá zlúčiť — najprv ho zastav"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A token is a password just for apps. tikjot uses it to read your tasks and write your worklogs as you. You can revoke it any time without changing your Atlassian password." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Token je heslo len pre aplikácie. tikjot ním číta tvoje úlohy a zapisuje worklogy v tvojom mene. Kedykoľvek ho môžeš zrušiť bez zmeny hesla k Atlassianu."
          }
        }
      }
