    },
    "The entries changed after you edited the comment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Záznamy sa zmenili po úprave komentára."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Jira address doesn't look right." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adresa Jiry nevyzerá správne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key that unlocks your data isn't in this Mac's Keychain any more — usually after moving to a new Mac or resetting the Keychain. Nothing was deleted. Restore the backup file you exported: it brings back everything except Jira tokens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kľúč, ktorý odomyká tvoje dáta, už nie je v Kľúčenke tohto Macu — zvyčajne po prechode na nový Mac alebo po resetovaní Kľúčenky. Nič sa nezmazalo. Obnov exportovaný súbor zálohy: vráti všetko okrem tokenov do Jiry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Keychain is locked or unavailable right now. Nothing was changed. Unlock your Mac's Keychain and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kľúčenka je práve zamknutá alebo nedostupná. Nič sa nezmenilo. Odomkni Kľúčenku na Macu a skús to znova."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The menu bar is full. Press %@ to open the timer, or open tikjot to move it back into view." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menu bar je plný. Stlač %@ a otvorí sa časovač, alebo otvor tikjot a presuň ho späť na viditeľné miesto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the month has just started" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mesiac sa práve začal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The older Jira becomes archived, read-only" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Staršia Jira sa archivuje, len na čítanie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rest stays in Unsent with Jira's reason." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zvyšok zostáva v Neodoslaných s dôvodom od Jiry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The running entry is left out until you stop it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bežiaci záznam sa vynechá, kým ho nezastavíš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server doesn't answer. Are you connected to your company VPN? If you are, turn it off and on again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Server neodpovedá. Si pripojený na firemnú VPN? Ak áno, vypni ju a znova zapni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the start of next month — the usual case" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "začiatok budúceho mesiaca — bežný prípad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The task or worklog no longer exists in Jira." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Úloha alebo worklog už v Jire neexistuje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The timer has been running for %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Časovač beží už %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The timer kept running. Keep that time or cut it?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Časovač bežal ďalej. Ponechať ten čas alebo ho odstrihnúť?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The token doesn't match. Create a personal access token in Jira: your profile › Personal Access Tokens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Token nesedí. Vytvor si v Jire osobný prístupový token: tvoj profil › Personal Access Tokens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The token is stored in your Keychain only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Token je uložený len v tvojej Kľúčenke."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The token is stored only in your Mac's Keychain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Token je uložený len v Kľúčenke tvojho Macu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The unreadable data is moved to a separate folder, not deleted." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nečitateľné dáta sa presunú do samostatného priečinka, nezmažú sa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The unreadable data is moved to a separate folder, not deleted. Whatever is in Jira comes back: connect Jira again and import your history." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nečitateľné dáta sa presunú do samostatného priečinka, nezmažú sa. Čo je v Jire, sa vráti: znova pripoj Jiru a naimportuj svoju históriu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This backup has dates or times tikjot can't use (before 1900, after 2200, or an entry of 48 hours or more). Nothing was changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Táto záloha obsahuje dátumy alebo časy, s ktorými tikjot nevie pracovať (pred rokom 1900, po roku 2200 alebo záznam dlhý 48 hodín a viac). Nič sa nezmenilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This day hasn't started" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tento deň ešte nezačal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This day is locked — read-only" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tento deň je uzamknutý — len na čítanie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This day is locked — read-only. Jira changes still arrive, marked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tento deň je uzamknutý — len na čítanie. Zmeny z Jiry sa stále prenesú, označené."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file isn't a tikjot backup or is damaged." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tento súbor nie je záloha tikjotu alebo je poškodený."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is Jira Cloud — tikjot switched to it. Use your email and an API token." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toto je Jira Cloud — tikjot to prepol. Použi e-mail a API token."
          }
        }
      }
